' rs-matter error & status types — position in the 21-crate workspace.
'
' Packages are labelled L0..L4 by dependency depth. A crate may only name
' types at its own level or BELOW. That is the binding constraint on the
' error redesign — see docs/error-system-requirements.md.
'
' Arrows:
'   -->                   From impl (implicit; `?` converts silently)
'   ..>                   hand-rolled or named conversion
'   -[#B91C1C]->          lossy conversion (collapses distinct inputs)
'   -[#B91C1C,dashed]->   BLOCKED: would be a crate cycle

@startuml rs-matter-errors-crates
title rs-matter errors — current position after the crate split

hide empty members
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
